          "value": "\n<ol><li>Collected on Dh\u016b\u02bel-qa\u02bfda</li>\n<li>that is Nisan 1558 &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Jacob b. aI-Najj\u0101r &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b\u02bel-M &hellip;.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b\u02bel-Fa\u1e0dl Bayy\u0101\u02bf &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b\u02bel-\u02bfIzz al-Mugharbil &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Jacob Naqq\u0101d &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Abraham Khabb\u0101z &hellip;.</li>\n<li>\u02bfAbdallah Saqq\u0101 &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Barak\u0101t Mutasawwiq &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Najam al-Parn\u0101s &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Mak\u0101rim \u1e62abb\u0101gh &hellip;.</li>\n<li>The wife of Fakhr &hellip;.</li>\n<li>The children of al-Ghuz\u016bl\u012b, 5.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Sa\u02bf\u012bd &hellip;.</li></ol>\n",
